# Digital Timer / Clock using PIC16F877A

## Overview
This project is a Digital Clock with Timer and Event Reminder system 
developed using PIC16F877A Microcontroller and 16x2 LCD Display.
It allows the user to set time, date, and events, and view them easily.

## Features
- Displays Time in HH:MM:SS format with AM/PM
- Displays Date in DD/MM/YYYY format
- Set Time / Date Option
- Set Event / View Event Option
- User-friendly Menu Navigation using Push Buttons
- Auto Return to Default Screen after 5 seconds of inactivity

## Hardware Required
- PIC16F877A Microcontroller
- 16x2 LCD Display
- Push Buttons (SW1, SW2)
- 20MHz Crystal Oscillator
- Power Supply (5V)


## Software Required
- MPLAB X IDE
- XC8 Compiler
- PICKit Programmer


## Button Controls
- **Short Press SW2:** Move to Next Option
- **Long Press SW1 (2 Sec):** Select / Enter
- **Long Press SW2 (2 Sec):** Go Back / Exit

## Screens
1. **Default Screen:** Shows Time and Date
2. **Config Screen:** SET/VIEW EVENT, SET TIME/DATE
3. **Set/View Event Screen:** SET EVENT, VIEW EVENT
4. **Set Time/Date Screen:** Set Time and Date

